# ============================================================================
#  PRIVACY FIRST — never commit personal genomic data to this repo.
#  This repo is for SCRIPTS and TOOLS only. All raw data, variant calls,
#  alignments, and derived per-individual results stay local and untracked.
#
#  The deny rules below are intentionally broad. If you think you need to
#  commit something matching one of these, stop and reconsider — almost
#  certainly you don't. See also the pre-commit guard in .githooks/.
# ============================================================================

# --- Raw sequence reads -----------------------------------------------------
*.fq
*.fastq
*.fq.gz
*.fastq.gz
*.ubam

# --- Alignments -------------------------------------------------------------
*.sam
*.bam
*.cram
*.bai
*.crai
*.csi

# --- Variant calls & their indexes ------------------------------------------
*.vcf
*.vcf.gz
*.gvcf
*.g.vcf
*.g.vcf.gz
*.bcf
*.tbi

# --- Reference genomes & indexes (large; download, don't commit) ------------
*.fa
*.fna
*.fasta
*.fa.gz
*.fasta.gz
*.fai
*.dict
*.amb
*.ann
*.bwt
*.pac
*.sa
*.bwt.2bit.64
*.0123

# --- Genomic interval / table data that may carry personal calls ------------
*.bed.gz
*.gff
*.gff3
*.gtf

# --- Vendor reports (contain personal health interpretations) ---------------
reports/
*.report.pdf

# --- All analysis / pipeline output (per-individual results live here) ------
analysis/
output/
results/
work/
tmp/
genome_insights*.json    # structured per-individual insights (served by MCP)

# --- MCP server virtualenv (local, not tracked) -----------------------------
mcp/.venv/
*.mosdepth.*
*.flagstat
*.idxstats

# --- Belt-and-suspenders: anything carrying the sample id or owner name -----
*SAMPLE_ID*
*Mastorakos*

# --- Environment / OS noise -------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
conda-env/
*.log

# ============================================================================
#  Explicitly ALLOWED (public reference data — not personal):
#    assets/traits/*.tsv  curated public rsID→trait maps (committed on purpose)
#  These are *.tsv and not matched by any deny rule above.
# ============================================================================
